{
  "_comment": "Translation table from the reference's utility classes to Pholio's component classes, used by golden-dom.mjs. Key: the class list of ONE element of the reference DOM, sorted alphabetically and joined with single spaces (exactly as golden-dom.mjs prints it under \"unmapped classes\"). Value: the class list the matching Pholio element must carry; it is sorted before the comparison as well, so its order is free. A key without an entry is not an error, it is only counted as unmapped (except with --strict-classes). Names follow nd-<component>[-<part>]; states stay on the data- and aria- attributes of the reference. The functional classes prose, not-prose, prose-no-margin, base-ui-disable-scrollbar, the lucide icon classes and light stay verbatim. The font class inter_<hash>-module__<hash>__className on <html> is a next/font build hash; Pholio sets the font directly on html in theme/css/fonts.css and therefore maps it to nothing. The rules of every nd- class live in theme/css/layout.css and theme/css/components.css, each with the utilities its declarations come from in a comment. The table also holds class lists that only appear at runtime or in templates (drawer, collapsible panel of the table of contents, section switcher popup, scroll area bars, search dialog); sources: the templates in src/components, the states/ folder of the reference export and the constants of the JavaScript modules (verify/CLASS-MAP.md). The catalogue components (tabs, code tabs, code block shell, accordion, file tree, type table, banner, inline table of contents) are merged in from class-map-catalogue.json; their rules are in theme/css/catalogue.css.",
